; the theorem "squares-non-negative" of number.kurt (proved there, by trichotomy): a square is not negative
load number
real a
show a * a >= 0
proof
    a * a >= 0              ; by "squares-non-negative"
qed

show (a + 1) * (a + 1) >= 0
proof
    (a + 1) * (a + 1) >= 0
qed

show ¬ (a * a < 0)
proof
    a * a >= 0
    ¬ (a * a < 0)
qed
